%% SpartanAssist workflow: one user request, two outcomes
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Student
    participant PG as Privacy Guard
    participant IN as Intake
    participant KN as Knowledge (RAG)
    participant WF as Workflow
    participant M as MCP tool server
    participant ES as Escalation
    participant RS as Responder
    actor T as IT staff

    S->>PG: "Library Wi-Fi keeps disconnecting"
    PG->>IN: redacted message (PII hidden)
    IN->>IN: category = network, P3, action = diagnostics
    IN->>KN: IT issue
    KN->>KN: top-2 chunks above floor, cite KB-NET-01
    KN->>WF: grounded + action
    WF->>M: run_network_diagnostics(user, building)
    M-->>WF: access point DEGRADED, Networking notified
    WF->>M: create_ticket(network, P3)
    M-->>WF: INC-261118-4EEEF
    WF->>RS: tool results + ticket
    RS-->>S: steps + source + "Done for you" + "Did this fix it?"

    alt Student taps "Yes, fixed"
        S->>M: update_ticket(resolved)
        M-->>S: ticket closed
    else Student taps "No, get a person"
        S->>ES: wants a person
        ES->>M: update_ticket(escalated, handoff note)
        ES->>RS: team = Networking, channel, SLA 1 business day
        RS-->>S: "A person is taking over" + ticket number
        M-->>T: ticket in queue with redacted request and agent path
    end
